{"id":"wb-6-967","name":"厦门破狱斗争旧址","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","status":"ready","title":"厦门破狱斗争旧址","text":"厦门破狱斗争旧址，位于福建省厦门市思明区思明南路473号。旧址是厦门大劫狱事件的发生地，小说《小城春秋》即以此事件创作。今存民国时期监牢三座、刑讯室一座，周边建有高4米的砖砌围墙，狱区占地面积近700平方米，建筑面积493平方米。监牢单层，砖、石、木结构，密梁双折坡布瓦顶平屋。1982年旧址被公布为厦门市第二批文物保护单位，1985年列为福建省第二批文物保护单位，2006年被列为第六批全国重点文物保护单位。现为福建省党史学习教育参观学习点、厦门市爱国主义教育基地。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E5%8E%A6%E9%97%A8%E7%A0%B4%E7%8B%B1%E6%96%97%E4%BA%89%E6%97%A7%E5%9D%80","revisionId":94360737,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=94360737","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与地理坐标一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/4cf8d255abdc91e9694e7305.jpg","title":"Former_Site_of_Xiamen_Prison_Breaking_Fight,_2019-09-27_01.jpg","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Former_Site_of_Xiamen_Prison_Breaking_Fight,_2019-09-27_01.jpg","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/5/5a/Former_Site_of_Xiamen_Prison_Breaking_Fight%2C_2019-09-27_01.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"Siyuwj","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0","caption":"​厦门破狱斗争旧址","width":320,"height":214}}